cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  The Tensegrity Knowledge Graph: A Holonic Architecture for
  Scientific Knowledge Representation
message: >-
  If you use this software or the corpus snapshots in your research,
  please cite the paper and this software repository.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Juan David
    family-names: Zuluaga-Monroy
